<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To deliver on this mission, Strategy offers the broadest array of delivery modes for analytics. This is why Strategy is trusted by thousands of the largest most well-known brands in the world. Another key reason is the Strategy Semantic Graph which weaves together data, business rules, relationships, and metadata so that components are reusable, inheritable, and privacy aware. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
