<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (If the data needed for a report is available in a published cube, the cube satisfies the request, eliminating the need to execute a separate query against the data warehouse. The most suitable cube is automatically selected from the available options. )
/E (If the data needed for a report is available in a published cube, the cube satisfies the request, eliminating the need to execute a separate query against the data warehouse. The most suitable cube is automatically selected from the available options. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
