<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (If the data cannot be found in an existing cube, Strategy generates a query directly against the backend data warehouse. It first checks the semantic graph for available aggregate tables, querying the smallest aggregate table that meets the request's requirements. If no aggregate table is available, Strategy will generate a source-native, optimized query against the base table\(s\) to retrieve the necessary data. )
