248 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Using AI to directly interpret and aggregate data can be unreliable. However, employing AI prompt engineering with a Semantic Graph resolves this issue. Prompt engineering fine-tunes the AI's language abilities to translate specific queries into actionable commands for the Semantic Graph. In this setup, the AI excels at translation rather than computation. It interprets the user's request through prompt engineering and maps it to components the Semantic Graph comprehends. The Strategy Semantic Graph, with its robust grasp of data relationships and standardized business logic, handles the computational task for accurate and reliable results. The illustration below details this intricate process, showing how both prompt engineering and the Semantic Graph act together as a crucial bridge in AI-BI integration: )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
